data.description:
@invideo.io launched FREE Editing Software that I just tested 🎞️

Comment “invideo” to get access and a full video walkthrough 🎥

The best thing about invideo Editor is that it has Agent Two directly built into it. So, I’ve just built a whole car sequence that looks one shot and has no cuts just by uploading my footage and giving one instruction to Agent Two. You still have all manual control + you can continue chatting with Agent Two and it will fix stuff based on what you tell it to do. 

There’s still work to be done but it’s already obvious where it is going and the base for it is so strong 💪 

I’m impressed 🤯

@invideo.creators
